<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PERSONAL PORTFOLIO DEMO</p><h1>Demo data &amp; privacy</h1></div></div>
<article class="panel detail-panel prose"><h2>Use fictional information</h2><p>VInternships demonstrates student, company and placement management. It does not submit applications, verify hours, contact supervisors or send emails. Seed names, placements and example.invalid addresses are fictional.</p><h2>Temporary records</h2><p>Records are held in application memory, separately for each browser session. They expire after 45 minutes, can be reset from the demo page and disappear when the service restarts. Do not enter real student records, contact information or confidential feedback.</p><h2>Cookies and hosting</h2><p>Essential cookies connect this browser to its workspace, protect forms and display success messages. This project includes no analytics or advertising scripts. The hosting provider may process ordinary request and operational logs under its own policies; those logs are separate from the disposable demo records.</p><h2>Project origin</h2><p>This personal continuation builds on a university ASP.NET project. Its original company, student and internship workflows have been extended with validation, isolated sample workspaces, additional record management and a responsive interface.</p></article>
